I walk down to the harbour and find the museum.
I go inside and buy a ticket.
"One adult, please," I say to the guard.
He gives me the ticket and tells me about the exhibition.
"Go down the stairs, and turn right," he says.
I look at the old ships for an hour.
Afterwards, I go back up.
I tell him that I would like to see The Little Mermaid.
He smiles and points out towards the water.
"Walk along the water here," he says.
"Walk past the small boats, then you can see her."
I say thank you for the help and go outside.
